OL,3,GNEWSAPanto's return 'brings village
OL,4,Atogether again' after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmateur dramatics performers said they
OL,7,Fwere "overwhelmed" to play to sell-out
OL,8,Fcrowds as they brought panto back to a
OL,9,Fvillage for the first time in 30 years.
OL,11,FNewly formed group The Ouseburn Players
OL,12,F(TOPS) performed The Very Hairy Tale of
OL,13,FOuseburn's Rapunzel on Friday and
OL,14,FSaturday at Great Ouseburn Village Hall
OL,15,Fin North Yorkshire.
OL,17,FAn annual pantomime was staged in the
OL,18,Fvillage by The Ouseburn Follies, until
OL,19,Fdeclining interest put paid to the play
OL,20,Fin 1996.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
