OL,3,GNEWSAPanto's return 'brings village
OL,4,Atogether again' after 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FLynsey Farnworth and Louise Farmer, who
OL,7,Fhad previously been involved in amateur
OL,8,Fdramatics in the nearby village of
OL,9,FWhixley, began working on the Great
OL,10,FOuseburn pantomime in November last
OL,11,Fyear.
